Package: astropaper
Title: AstroPaper-Styled HTML Documents for R Markdown
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Timothy", "Starman",
           email = "timothystarman2005@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An 'R Markdown' HTML output format that replaces the default
    Bootstrap styling with the AstroPaper theme: Tailwind-based typography,
    the Google Sans Code typeface, KaTeX math, an optional table of contents
    and a min-light syntax highlighting palette.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    rmarkdown
Suggests:
    knitr,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
URL: https://github.com/2b-creator/AstroPapeR
BugReports: https://github.com/2b-creator/AstroPapeR/issues
